
doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Abstract Submission Confirmation - SCM Conference 2026

  body(
    style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#FDFCFB; font-family:'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;"
  )
    .wrapper(style="padding:30px 10px;")
      .container(
        style="max-width:600px; margin:auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border:1px solid #f1f5f9;"
      )

        //- HEADER
        include header

        .content(style="padding:40px;")
          h2(
            style=`margin:0 0 25px; color:${brandBlue}; font-size:24px;`
          )
            | Abstract Submission Confirmation

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Dear
            strong  #{authorName},

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Greetings from the Organizing Committee of the
            strong  International Conference on Building Resilient Supply Chains
            | , hosted by the Department of Business Administration, East West University.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | We have received your abstract submission for the upcoming conference scheduled for
            strong  18–19 December 2026
            | .

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Your submission is currently undergoing a rigorous double-blind peer review process in accordance with the conference’s academic standards and guidelines. The outcome of the review process will be communicated to you by
            strong  30 September 2026
            | .

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | We appreciate your interest in contributing to this conference and your engagement with the theme of building resilient and sustainable supply chains.

          p(style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Should you require any further information, please contact us at

            a(
              href="mailto:helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu"
              style=`color:${brandBlue}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold;`
            )
              | helpdesk-scm@ewubd.edu

          p(style="margin:30px 0 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8;")
            | Thank you for your submission. We look forward to your participation.

        //- FOOTER
        include footer
